# The Daily Challenge: today's seed and par, then hints and Enter until no
# piece fits; the results compare with today's best (this device).
until 300 Play
frames 30
click =Daily Challenge
until 60 One shared seed
frames 10
expect Next daily in
save daily-setup
click =Start
until 120 Daily: highest score
frames 30
repeat 12000 until Round Over
  key KeyH 1
  frames 3
  key Enter 1
  frames 10
end
frames 30
expect No offered piece fits on the board.
expect Daily complete — best today:
save daily-results
click =Home
until 60 Learn to Play
